 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** Depends on the number of surface leaves and the depth difference between leaves and their neighbors. Each iteration may trigger a full re-evaluation of new corners. The number of iterations is bounded by the depth difference `max_depth - min_depth` [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Memory Complexity:** Proportional to the number of nodes in the octree and the cache size for function evaluations [S1, unofficial].
